      "approved_by": "supervisor, as reported by the project owner on 2026-11-26 (configs/approvals.yaml)",
      "justification": "Reference temperature T0 = 290 K (P.372 section 1.2.1), giving -174 dBm/Hz (M.2412 Table 5)."
