      "approved_by": "supervisor, as reported by the project owner on 2026-11-26 (configs/approvals.yaml)",
      "justification": "-10 dB is the lowest SINR at which the 3GPP link-level throughput mapping gives any data rate (TR 38.921 Table 4.2.7-1, TR 36.942 Annex A). A noise-referenced threshold is the same physical condition at every bandwidth."
